category":"lobby","text":"ミランダ警告の3つ目って……なんでしたっけ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/lBJzyyxSUp8zWPjHYZ301A4iP086Zi3S.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お帰りなさい、先生。 よろしければ、すぐにパトロールに出ようと思うのですが ご一緒にいかがですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/Up1JoaYh1FBEEMAkzkZA3ys6KKvbPpg2.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お帰りなさい、先生。 ここに来るまでに怪しい人はいませんでしたか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/c9qjaQbdxGGXp0wFLgAjLciqDJcyNzc9.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"（ど、どうしましょう……！ ふんっ、んっ……！は、外れない……！）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/w28Y2aut28Ue9EWGBKRqAsunDx4GAsLH.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……え？い、いやいや！ 仮にも警察に属する本官が、鍵を失くすわけがないではありませんか！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/XZVgYYgjCcU9jFw5mm68283SZEv2p3Br.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"で、ですから、これは……。 だ、脱出訓練の予行演習です！ ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/aqrcdmcJiTehfZIOtOIoWZFChaR5NjB2.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"想定外の事態が起きて、万が一拘束されてしまった時のために…… これより本官が、 脱出の仕方をお見せします！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/CHfeP8nh9BhvcRVWyslT9tvgjjv8OmGn.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ご安心ください！ 本官のようにしっかり訓練を積んだ者であれば、 これくらい簡単ですから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/scFxaWdFbvLVPjxdVdOTnGrUpJJU2pB2.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"くうううっ……！ふぬぬぬぬぬぬっ……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/RvJ2AaljmjDbAEjeLYypXuEeVHItr5LZ.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……ごめんなさい。 助けてください、先生ぇ……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/B9p0pwTJT4fIUFpk0V3OUiDHrjeoeLuB.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"さすが先生ですね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/vWLLUucjZCxkMI0k2xbd05ux9KgoE9Ea.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"本官もいつか先生のような立派な大人になりたいです！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/ImhFnro61CxtBUL5o4XlRSFzmkND1Ruf.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":" （本官はまったく、これが業務に過ぎないのに、勘違いをするところでした）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/nZB8B4BU5FxSfafMY471BUN5pD3YxgkT.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生と生徒が恋愛をするというのは、キヴォトスでは犯罪ではありません！ い、言いたいことはそれだけです……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/rutMvV9rxdBNuAYoTLduEiBE1Nv7XPG8.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"私の誕生日を覚えていてくださったなんて…… 感激しました、先生！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/QjaTIO5yQKzs7euBIEHqI1wtc9zz5OzM.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。 ただし、いくら誕生日だからってルール違反はダメですよ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/xp7Ny9qkvEwOwVo3u74lqc11ajDddP7U.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あっ、またみだらな格好で街を歩く生徒たちが……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/3IOItt7Js5KhDOsXeTGQDeBk4fnbkslo.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとうございます、先生。 今年もキヴォトスの治安のために一緒に頑張りましょう！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/9q7YZMURqpmZi0h9ZY9uqkjiq6dux7PY.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"市民の安全を守ることは年中無休！ クリスマスでも 油断できません！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/ujmPJtIeBdCQvU15mPhIl8fPIyBtc7MP.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"正義は敗北……しません……！うぅ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/Eup9UURtbu3ZbG9wGedoRhrUCbMc8Jyn.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"本官のミスです……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/ATGllWbwOFPhHOChC3O0Ir6zvH1o8sIh.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Tactic_In_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"市民の安全を最優先で行きましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/DjxKTJG7HFFjUmyfU5Ltc310gDCQbXeZ.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Tactic_In_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"犯罪者はどこですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/FaSeznW8qMhCazHpCq1tw6FdrDY8NMuI.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"任務、完了しました！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/mizZleHg1gu2MP4h5wx4lgqbPfOlIgdK.ogg"},{"description":"Kirino_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"右、左……ふぅ、ここはもう安全です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E