aget","category":"growup","text":"我是瓦尔基丽的桐乃！全都举起手来，听我指示！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/aiK6fRebSAB0fEjH7rQKLToqkhNtjzGe.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"继续这样努力的话，我会不会，被调到警备局呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/kSK7BlMMQg6cBQ5aW55gEKbgMXIyyIp9.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"为了基沃托斯的安全，我会全力以赴！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/OWkm8YYP5xoc31UbXZeH7kgfHfsOAlQj.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，今天的训练成果很不错！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/uPLeRz3iCNyG1hwXrquP94xBcK3rR0vi.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"感谢您的协助。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/JSgWkNrs6cVczI10OjJ0urX1Fl8epNeF.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？有什么要问本警员的吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/7PrbO9vybEMfZkjLtJZt4Mm2YZYW4N9m.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"我想……帮助基沃托斯的人们。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/qJKhNH7kfBkx2s5D6xVeip8MAOqxxmhF.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"这附近好吃的可多了，每次巡逻或值班都盼着能来这儿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/7RcCK06fPdKg00WdKydFzX7In1VO6qsX.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"啊，但我巡逻的时候可没有偷懒啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/dc7IuozJQA6SPbYE2jEldVIvbo0wlSr0.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"米兰达警告的第三条……是什么来着？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/KfStijpwsirhswJW0T3a2pJ75Rr7wQ3L.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"您回来了，老师。不介意的话，现在马上出去巡逻怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/fCslH6u1AGI70FVJv0wLy6JdB3da8SCx.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"您回来了，老师。来的路上有没有看到可疑的人呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/dzp2LCm0VRNsQofMhumoCCOR4tZH2neN.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"（呜呜，怎么办……？这，这个手铐……！解，解不开啊……！）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/xFZqn8pyufJPUtoEzUhWAZXjflFRm4rj.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"……啊？不，不会的！身为警员，怎么可能把钥匙弄丢呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/dslsJdjK0R2eFuVlCSdQL7IbTNwikoSr.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"这，这是，是……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/G3TuG2omtaMbuLAHn4PIeDBghGMB982J.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"是在演示逃生方法！本警员在亲自演示意外情况下，双手被铐住时，该如何逃生！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/YGI5EoFwmlYJCOFEf74YysnitAqCgDoQ.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"请放心！对我这种训练有素的警员来说，这种情况是小菜一碟！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/741KIFTJ9e6T2qqS1ioCVTg5KdCjIhU2.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"呃呃啊……！呃呃呃啊……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/tIKQ6V3AdZsL0bZvVAqB5DF0jpIPfJmX.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……对不起。请帮帮我，老师……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/WngUQcdmiJZZIVK4mpsc5Tu6R1ULt1RM.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"不愧是老师啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/NxCywPfwNefmBxvghnHzPdyyOlwZkU0K.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"本警员，总有一天也要成为老师这样优秀的大人！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/8AG2aZZalrH9L7fgTnbOITSuzQrYSArG.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"这只是工作而已，本警员差点就误会了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/oyI8vlmBhf7ruEGAXE1GAfzBo352hI3F.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"在基沃托斯，跨越身份的恋爱并不算犯罪。我，我想说的就是这个……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/4MU9NDTLA5yrFYCfivNqAoAQbtVRRYZG.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"居然还记得我的生日……我太感动了，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/2KPC3sUIzE5IV27FaY4BPCEAcZBrsBpg.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐！不过，就算是生日，违规也要受罚的哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/XkiIVLmrka0EIK5J3mVcxX7cZV61ZdN7.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"好热闹啊！嗯！新年也不能放松对市民安全的维护，老师，和本警员一起巡逻吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%A1%20%E6%A1%90%E4%B9%83/x4hecc496v0wHVsE9AlakYkP4NuNfil8.ogg"},{"description":"kirino_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"诶，又有人衣衫不整地在街上走来走去了……